        "title": {
          "ja": "Su–Olson1996非平衡拡散",
          "en": "Su–Olson1996 non-equilibrium diffusion"
        },
        "summary": {
          "ja": "実際の放射・物質2場とMarshak境界を進め、固定版ExactPackの独立積分参照と比較します。",
          "en": "Advance actual radiation/material fields with the Marshak boundary and compare with independently qualified pinned ExactPack integrals."
        },
        "assumptions": {
          "ja": "無次元ε1、区間[0,16]、初期u=v0、左Robin入射、右0。128/256/512セルと時間半減・区間24probe。",
          "en": "Nondimensionalepsilon1,x0..16,initialu=v0,leftRobin inflow/right0;128/256/512cells plus half-step/domain24probes."
        },
        "algorithm": {
          "ja": "保存的FVと後退Euler。放射物質の反対sourceを同じSchur補元で結合し、Robinのβ+h/2半セル抵抗を用います。ε.25/2の同じ交換operatorも解析検査します。",
          "en": "Conservative FV/backwardEuler with opposite exchange sources coupled by a shared Schur complement and Robin half-cell resistance beta+h/2. Analytic nonunitepsilon.25/2controls exercise the same exchange operators."
        },
        "validation": {
          "ja": "独立参照54項目を輸送ケースと共有して資格済み。5主計算で独立u/v誤差、全stepの容量重み収支・正値、時間・有限領域差を分離します。",
          "en": "The independent54check reference study is shared with transport. Five primary runs separate u/vreferenceerror,all-step capacity-weighted budgets/positivity,time and finite-domain sensitivity."
        },
        "limits": {
          "ja": "1996拡散であり1997角度輸送とは別です。原典本文は未読、公式ソフトの選択値を資格。物理単位の質量opacity解釈は使わず無次元関数を直接参照します。",
          "en": "This1996diffusion model is distinct from1997angular transport. Original paper fulltext unread;officialsoftware selected values qualified. Direct dimensionless functions avoid ambiguous mass-opacity physical-wrapper units."
        },
        "formulas": [
          "\\epsilon u_\\tau-u_{xx}=v-u,\\quad v_\\tau=u-v",
          "u(0,\\tau)-\\frac2{\\sqrt3}u_x(0,\\tau)=1",
          "\\epsilon=4a/\\alpha,\\quad e_m/E_0=v/\\epsilon,\\quad \\mathcal E=\\epsilon u+v"
        ],
